  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated WASH and Nutrition Initiative (IWANI) to promote health, and optimum growth and development for the most vulnerable children and women in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide integrated WASH and nutrition and child development engagements to prevent illnesses, malnutrition and developmental deprivation among the most vulnerable children and women in Lebanon. The project targets 481,000 affected people with WASH activities and 130,000 with Nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
